.TH "LIBVIRT-DBUS" "8" "" ""
.SH "نام (NAME)"
libvirt-dbus \- D-Bus daemon exporting libvirt API
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
.sp
\fBlibvirt\-dbus\fP [\fIOPTION\fP]...
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
.sp
libvirt\-dbus wraps libvirt API to provide a high\-level object\-oriented
API better suited for dbus\-based applications.
.sp
Normally libvirt\-dbus is started by D\-Bus daemon on demand.
.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
.sp
\fB\-h \-\-help\fP
.INDENT 0.0
.INDENT 3.5
Display command line help usage then exit.
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.sp
\fB\-\-system\fP
.INDENT 0.0
.INDENT 3.5
Connect to the system bus.
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.sp
\fB\-\-session\fP
.INDENT 0.0
.INDENT 3.5
Connect to the session bus.
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.sp
\fB\-t \-\-threads\fP \fINUM\fP
.INDENT 0.0
.INDENT 3.5
Configure maximal number of worker threads.
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.SH "اشکالات (BUGS)"
.sp
Please report all bugs you discover.  This should be done via either:
.INDENT 0.0
.IP a. 3
the mailing list
.UNINDENT
.INDENT 0.0
.INDENT 3.5
 <https://libvirt.org/contact.html> 
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.INDENT 0.0
.IP b. 3
the bug tracker
.UNINDENT
.INDENT 0.0
.INDENT 3.5
 <https://libvirt.org/bugs.html> 
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.sp
Alternatively, you may report bugs to your software distribution / vendor.
.SH "نویسندگان (AUTHORS)"
.sp
Please refer to the AUTHORS file distributed with libvirt\-dbus.
